spawn.failed=Failed to spawn dogs
despawn.success=%name% has been despawned
despawn.info=Your dog is safe and can be respawned later with /dog spawn

release.success=You have released %name%. They are now wild.

owner.wild=This dog is wild and has no owner
owner.info=%name% belongs to %owner%

list.header=Your dogs:
